<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>Forever In Love</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">1nonly</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">Forever In Love</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">2I1MpmdR17ds205JyqhNHh</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1">8 Contributors</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Forever In love Lyrics</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[Chorus]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I love to see your smile, like I love a sunny day</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Looking at your eyes, but my eyes don't look away</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I feel that I am trapped in this small plastic bag</p><p ttm:agent="v1">But I feel that I am free with you whenever I am sad</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Dream about your kisses, the best we ever had</p><p ttm:agent="v1">And never thinkin' twice about being like a dad</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Always textin' you, repeatedly, whenever you were mad</p><p ttm:agent="v1">But you left me, so violently, but that wasn't so bad</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[Verse]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">The worst part was seeing you with him, your lover</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Told you, even though we split, still love you forever</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Told you, even though we fought, I put no one above her</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Always feeling hatred, but I loved you when you suffered</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I wouldn't get you back, was something I discovered</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Thinking about laying in your room when it would thunder</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I would be so happy, like babies when they color</p><p ttm:agent="v1">We always thinking 'bout when you'd be a mother</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Sky is faking, vegas [?]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Set-up getting boring, kisses getting shorter</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I was going to your house, sneaking in past five</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Making love, talkin', everything is right</p><p ttm:agent="v1">And there's laughs, giggles, smiling together</p><p ttm:agent="v1">It's the fact that you said that you loved me, you would never</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Quit telling all my friends that I was happy when I got you</p><p ttm:agent="v1">The movie theater dates, smoking marjuana</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Meeting everyday, and always talking 'bout your classroom</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I'd always want to stay, whenever I got to see you</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Staring at your eyes, damn, I never wanna leave you</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Holding you so tight in my arms, never free you</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I just wanna say, that I love you so much</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Being right next to you, being in touch</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Always meeting up with you, before and after lunch</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Giving you my heart, but who is to judge?[Chorus]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I love to see your smile, like I love a sunny day</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Looking at your eyes, but my eyes don't look away</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I feel that I am trapped in this small plastic bag</p><p ttm:agent="v1">But I feel that I am free with you, whenever I am sad</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Dream about your kisses, the best we ever had</p><p ttm:agent="v1">And never thinkin' twice about being like a dad</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Always textin' you, repeatedly, whenever you were mad</p><p ttm:agent="v1">But you left me, so violently, but that wasn't so bad</p></div></body></tt>